# ios RESOURCES — the embedder's C-array accession table, DECLARED here and
# materialized into hosts/ios/Tools/gen_bundle_resources.py by
# tools/gen-staging-emit.mjs (row order = block order: the emitted C arrays
# and the Swift-linked dsh_runtime_res_<suffix> accessors consume it).
# `<suffix>=<rel>` stages runtime/dsh/<rel>; `repo:` stages a repo-root file
# at the same bundle path. A new row is a hand decision (the suffix is a
# Swift/C link name no derivation can mint); graph coverage of everything a
# row omits stays with check-staging's ios surface (blocking, earlier in the
# DAG).
